<title>POLAND: Unibud surges 93.3 pct on bourse debut.</title>
<headline>Unibud surges 93.3 pct on bourse debut.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-05-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish construction company Unibud SA started trade on the bourse's main market at 29 zlotys, 93.3 percent above the issue price. The January one-million-share initial public offering of the firm, priced at 15 zlotys per share, was oversubscribed.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
